<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the Panhandle area late Monday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 4,700 slaughter steers and 3,500 heifers; 11,200 head confirmed for week to date.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 975-1150 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:   8,200     Week Ago:   None     Year Ago:  11,100</p>
<p>Wk to date: 11,200     Week Ago: 15,900     Year Ago:  27,700</p>
</text>
